# Review on risky PRs

CI (lint, test, GitGuardian) runs on every PR. That is the first reviewer.

If the diff touches cabinet APIs, RSVP, login/session, payment/receipt, event schema or slug, or a guest skin: after the PR exists, **remind** the user to open a **new** chat, paste the PR link, and run `/review-bugbot`. Do not open that chat. Do not run Bugbot in the authoring chat.

Copy, CSS, `.mdc`, and docs: diff plus CI is enough. Offer commit / push / PR / «вливай» in this chat. Do not require Bugbot.

Merge only when the user says «вливай». A reminder does not block merge if they still say to merge.
